{"title":"IMO problems statistics since 2000","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>This page lists the number of IMO problems per proposing country from the year 2000 onwards.\n</p><p>(Currently it covers the IMOs from the years 2000-2021.)\n</p>\n<table style=\"text-align:right\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"5\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>#problems</th>\n<th>: proposed by country\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>13</td>\n<td>Russia\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>Poland\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>South Korea\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>Australia\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>Iran\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>Romania\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>USA\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>Austria\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>France\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>Luxembourg\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>Netherlands\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>Serbia\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>Ukraine\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>Belgium\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>Bulgaria\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>Canada\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>Czech Republic\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>Greece\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>India\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>South Africa\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>Albania\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>Belarus\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>Croatia\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>Estonia\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>Hungary\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>Ireland\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>Japan\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>United Kingdom\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>Armenia\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>Brazil\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>Colombia\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>El Salvador\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>Finland\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>Georgia\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>Germany\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>Ho